# Practice-gen validation harness output: regenerated by every run_all /
# validate_matrix invocation (including single --node runs and the mutation
# harness), which overwrite it wholesale -- committing it meant any local run
# left the tree dirty and blocked plain git operations. CI already captures it
# via actions/upload-artifact on failure (deploy-backend.yml), so nothing
# depends on it being in git history.
validation_reports/matrix_report.json
